\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nh\'fd sau:
\par a) Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ti\'ean ph\u7843\'3fi d\'f9ng c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp l\'e0: V\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp b\u7893\'3f sung n\'e3m 1994, v\u7889\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ch\'fda d\'f9ng trong n\'e3m 1994, c\'e1c qu\u7929\'3f h\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p nh\'fd: Qu\u7929\'3f
 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh, qu\u7929\'3f d\u7921\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  ph\'f2ng, qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7929\'3f \'f0\u7873\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  ph\'f2ng . . . thanh l\'fd t\'e0i s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7843\'3fn v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd kh\'f4ng c\u7847\'3fn d\'f9ng, v\u7889\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn kh\'e1c \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n. N\u7871\'3fu thi\u7871\'3fu s\u7869\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc vay v
\u7889\'3fn m\u7891\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc trong m\u7897\'3ft \'f0\u7871\'3fn hai n\'e3m, l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'e3i xu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7845\'3ft 0,8%/th\'e1ng trong \'f0\'f3 0,5% tr\u7843\'3f cho ch\u7911\'3f n\u7907\'3f d\'f9ng k\u7923\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu thanh to\'e1n.
\par b) Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\'f3 ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu, Ban thanh to\'e1n n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi xem x\'e9t doanh nghi\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 p c\'f2n n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng kh\'e1c kh\'f4ng, n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3
 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh to\'e1n cho:
\par - C\'e1c m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng, gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f, t\'fd nh\'e2n, qu\u7929\'3f t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng, c
\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng.
\par - Tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i (N\u7871\'3fu c\'f3).
\par - Tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ph\u7847\'3fn n\u7907\'3f g\u7889\'3fc qu\'e1 h\u7841\'3fn \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'e3 k\'ea khai x\'e1c nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7853\'3fn (k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f v\u7889\'3fn m\u7891\'3fi vay giai \'f0o\u7841\'3fn I).
\par - Tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch.
\par N\u7871\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 u c\'f2n s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7889\'3f ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi t}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 hu th\'ec }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi
\u7879\'3fp.
\par 2/ Thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng v
\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f:
\par - Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\'f3 ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu, \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh v\'e0o t\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f c\'e1c m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f m\'e0
 doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh to\'e1n theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c
\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, ph\u7847\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch kh\'f4ng thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc  doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o l\u7895\'3f v\'e0 tr\u7915\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  v\'e0o l\'e3i th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn n\'e3m 1994 v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng n\'e3m sau (n\u7871\'3f
u l\'e0 nguy\'ean nh\'e2n kh\'e1ch quan) . N\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 nguy\'ean nh\'e2n ch\u7911\'3f quan c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f n\u7907\'3f, tr\u7915\'3f v\'e0o qu\u7929\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, truy c\u7913\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\'e1 nh\'e2n v\'e0
 ph\u7843\'3fi b\u7891\'3fi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng  b\u7857\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par - Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\'f3 ch\u7879\'3fn l\u7879\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, ph
\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 i t\'ecm m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7885\'3fi ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi
\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n, n\u7871\'3fu thi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc vay ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn m\u7891\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n.
\par 3/  Thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f gi\u7919\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ngo\'e0i qu\u7889\'3fc doanh, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng, t\'fd nh
\'e2n.
\par - Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f, ph\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 i thanh to\'e1n s\'f2
ng ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7859\'3fng c\'e1c m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f cho h\u7885\'3f, c\u361\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc d\'f9ng c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn nh\'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841
\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1 v\'e0  2 n\'eau tr\'ean.
\par - Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu,  c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ngo\'e0i qu\u7889\'3fc doanh, t\'fd nh\'e2n, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng ph\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
