\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng n\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  th\'ec Ban thanh to\'e1n n}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7907\'3f c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng c\'e1c bi\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p c\'fd\u7905\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f (Th\'f4ng t\'fd 05/TTLN) bu\u7897\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi thanh to
\'e1n v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn k\'ea bi\'ean t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\u7915\'3f 200.000 \'f0 tr\u7903\'3f  l\'ean, \'f0em ph\'e1t m\u7841\'3fi c\'f4ng khai \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f, n\u7871\'3fu c\u7889\'3f}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  t\'ecnh kh\'f4ng thanh to\'e1n chuy}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7875\'3fn h\u7891\'3f s\'f5 sang c\'f5 quan n\u7897
\'3fi ch\'ednh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo Lu\u7853\'3ft t\u7889\'3f t\u7909\'3fng d\'e2n s\u7921\'3f ho\u7863\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 c h\'ecnh s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7921\'3f.
\par Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7889\'3f n\u7907\'3f ch\'fda thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc trong n\'e3m 1994, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ch\u7901\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft. To\'e0n b
\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f n\u7907\'3f ch\'fda thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn sang c\'f5 quan n\u7897\'3fi ch\'ednh v\'e0 c\'f5 quan chuy\'ean m\'f4n sau khi gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f Ban thanh to\'e1n n\u7907\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f ti\u7871\'3fp t
\u7909\'3fc thu h\u7891\'3fi cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 x\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  l\'fd theo Ph\'e1p lu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
