 Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, n\u7871\'3fu thi\u7871\'3fu h\u7909\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 t kh\'f4ng c\'f3 l\'fd do ch\'ednh \'f0\'e1ng Ban thanh l\'fd
 doanh nghi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7879\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi b\u7891\'3fi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi chuy\u7875\'3fn sang c\'f5 quan n\u7897\'3fi ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f 
