\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. Nh\'fd v\u7853\'3fy c\'f4ng n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f bao g\u7891\'3fm  c\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f sau 30/4/1991 (N\u7871\'3fu doanh nghi\u7879
\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f sau 30/4/1991).
\par - Th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu h\u7891\'3fi n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng, kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f, t\'fd nh\'e2n, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng, c\'f5
 quan \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\'e1 nh\'e2n d\'f9ng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, ti\u7873\'3fn thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn v\'e0
o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Ban thanh to\'e1n n\u7907\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n cho c\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f n\u7907\'3f.
\par - T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ph\'e1t m\u7841\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn, v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd h\'e0ng ho\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, theo Th\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889\'3f 05/TTLN ng\'e0y 21/8/92, to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f gi\'e1 tr
\u7883\'3f b\'e1n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\'fda v\'e0o ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n cho c\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng theo th\u7913\'3f t\u7921\'3f thanh to\'e1n quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3f
i Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 330/H\'d0BT ng\'e0y 23/10/1991 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng (nay l\'e0 Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f).
\par S\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7841\'3fi n\u7871\'3fu do nguy\'ean nh\'e2n ch\u7911\'3f quan c
\'e1 nh\'e2n g\'e2y n\'ean th\u7845\'3ft tho\'e1t \'f0\'fda sang c\'f5 quan n\u7897\'3fi ch\'ednh \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tra x\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  l\'fd v\'e0 thu h}{\rtlch\fcs1 
