\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp s\'e1p nh\u7853\'3fp, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ti\u7871\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'e1c ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft nh\u7919\'3fng m
\'f3n n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp s\'e1p nh\u7853\'3fp nh\'fd th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp c\u7845\'3fp 3 s\'e1p nh\u7853\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp c\u7845\'3fp 2.  Tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ti\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b
\'f9 tr\u7915\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f trong n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp s\'e1p nh\u7853\'3fp, s\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 
