\rtlch\fcs1 \af37\afs26\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 1/ N\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi thu:
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng, sau khi thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn n\u7907\'3f theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
