\par S\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7841\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc xem x\'e9t l\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7889
\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn vay c\'f3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\'fang t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch c\u7911\'3fa ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn kh\'f4ng, n\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fang \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch
\u7881\'3fnh cho \'f0\'fang, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh kh\u7871\'3f \'fd\u7899\'3fc tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f theo kh\u7871\'3f \'fd\u7899\'3fc m\u7899\'3fi, \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy
\u7875\'3fn g\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 c v\'e0 l\'e3i t\'ednh t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7915\'3f ng\'e0y chuy\u7875\'3fn d
\u7883\'3fch nh\'fd: Vay v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng, s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng cho x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5  b\u7843\'3fn, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi th\u7871\'3f ch\u7845\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 
