 cho x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn trung h\u7841\'3fn, ho\u7863\'3fc d\'e0i h\u7841\'3fn.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid791519 p}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng, gi
\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 5 Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 330/H\'d0BT c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng (nay l\'e0
 Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f).
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi kinh t\u7871\'3f ngo\'e0i qu\u7889\'3fc doanh ph\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 i t\'ecm m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7885\'3fi ngu\u7891\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n c\u7843\'3f g\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 c v\'e0 l\'e3i, n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7871\'3fu ch\u7853\'3fm tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi ph\'e1t m\u7841\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, c\'e1 nh\'e2n \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f.
\par S\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7841\'3fi kh\'f4ng thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v
\'e0o nguy\'ean nh\'e2n \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'e3 x\'e1c }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, n\u7871\'3fu do kh\'e1
ch quan \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\u7915\'3f (g\u7889\'3fc) v\'e0o n\'e3m k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng.
\par N\u7871\'3fu do nguy\'ean nh\'e2n ch\u7911\'3f quan c\u7911\'3fa kh\'e1ch n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc khoanh n\u7907\'3f v\'e0 thu d\u7847\'3fn cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng chuy\u7875\'3fn h\u7891\'3f s\'f5
 sang c\'f5 quan n\u7897\'3fi ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f xem x\'e9t truy c\u7913\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm d\'e2n s\u7921\'3f ho\u7863\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 c h\'ecnh s}{\rtlch\fcs1 
