\par 2/ N\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3)
\par Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng thanh to\'e1n cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng kh\'e1c, tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ti\'ean b\'f9 tr\u7915\'3f v\'e0o n\u7907\'3f qu\'e1 h\u7841\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng v\'e0 v\u7889\'3fn m\u7891\'3f
i vay giai \'f0o\u7841\'3fn I.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s16\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid791519 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af38\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f38\fs20\expnd4\expndtw24\cf2\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
