\u7883\'3f l\'e0m th\u7845\'3ft tho\'e1t ph\u7843\'3fi truy c\u7913\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm theo Ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft.
\par 2/ N\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f:
\par Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ch\u7881\'3f c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng kho\u7843\'3fn:
\par + Vay \'f0\u7875\'3f chi ti\'eau
\par + Kh\u7889\'3fi l\'fd\u7907\'3fng x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn trong k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'e3 ho\'e0n th\'e0nh ch}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'fda \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t v\u7889\'3fn.
\par + C\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp b\'f9 theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ch\'fda \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t.
\par + C\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn  n\u7897\'3fp th\u7915\'3fa Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch.
\par Trong th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'e3 s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kh\'e1c \'f0\u7875\'3f x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft ngo\'e0i k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch, c\'f5
 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh ki\u7875\'3fm tra c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 ng c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
