\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7845\'3ft, m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 a c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
