\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 C\'f4ng tr\'ecnh ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f cho s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh d
\'f9ng v\u7889\'3fn vay Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng trung h\u7841\'3fn, d\'e0i h\u7841\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n, n\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng vay thanh to\'e1n Ban thanh to\'e1n n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn t\'e0i s
