\u7901\'3fi ra quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng ngo\'e0i k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch, tu\u7923\'3f m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  c\'f3 h\'ecnh th}{
