\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7841\'3fi theo t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng, cho B\u7897\'3f, ng\'e0nh \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi kinh t\u7871\'3f Trung 
\'fd\'f5ng.
\par - Sau khi chuy\u7875\'3fn d\u7883\'3fch n\u7907\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng m\'f3n n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f ngo\'e0i t\u7881\'3fnh, nay chuy\u7875\'3fn th\'e0nh n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f trong t\u7881\'3fnh cho c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879
\'3fp c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi thu ngo\'e0i t\u7881\'3fnh, ph\u7843\'3fi thu c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng v\'e0 Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f thu n\u7907\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3f
i doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'e1 nh\'e2n c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f  c\'e1 nh\'e2n c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f cho c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 c\'e1 nh\'e2n c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc thu t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng, n\u7897\'3fp v\u7873\'3f Trung \'fd\'f5ng ph\u7847\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7889\'3f n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr
\u7843\'3f.
\par - T\u7915\'3fng B\u7897\'3f, ng\'e0nh c\u361\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn d\u7883\'3fch n\u7907\'3f nh\'fd t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, c\'e1c B\u7897\'3f, ng\'e0nh ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7853\'3fn thu c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3f
i tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f trong B\u7897\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 , ng\'e0nh m\'ecnh, tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7843\'3f cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f, ng\'e0nh n\u7897\'3fp v\u7873\'3f Trung \'fd\'f5ng ph\u7847\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f
 theo t\u7881\'3f l\u7879\'3f thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7889\'3f n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f.
\par - V\'ed d\u7909\'3f m\u7897\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng hay m\u7897\'3ft B\u7897\'3f c\'f3 s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi thu 100 t\u7927\'3f s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f 150 t\u7927\'3f th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fn thu 90 t\u7927\'3f
 b\u7857\'3fng 60% s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng ho\u7863\'3fc B\u7897\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f cho c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 c\'e1 nh\'e2n 60 t\u7927\'3f n\u7897\'3f
p Trung \'fd\'f5ng 30 t\u7927\'3f.
\par \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, B\u7897\'3f, ng\'e0nh c\'f3 ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng thanh to\'e1n sau khi Trung \'fd\'f5ng thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph
\u7847\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh,th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, B\u7897\'3f, ng\'e0nh. S\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  c\'f2n l}{
