\par 3/ Thanh to\'e1n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp c\'f3 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1p nh
\'e2n tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc Ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft. Nh\u7919\'3fng nh\'fd\u7901\'3fi \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn cho ph\'e1p nh\'e2n  kinh t\u7871\'3f l\'e0 Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc, ph\'f3 Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn b\u7893\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm \'f0\u7875\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft nh\u7919\'3fng c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1p nh\'e2n kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\'f3. Khi m\u7897\'3ft m
\'f3n n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7875\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f, Gi\u7845\'3fy gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p nh\'e2n kinh t\u7871\'3f u\u7927\'3f quy
\u7873\'3fn cho ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn, gi\u7845\'3fy vi\u7871\'3ft tay \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 c ghi r\'f5 ch}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
