c danh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7893\'3f nhi\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 m th\'ec c\'e1 nh\'e2n k\'fd ch}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 
\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm thanh to\'e1n.
\par N\u7871\'3fu ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn cho ph\'e1p nh\'e2n kinh t\u7871\'3f l\'e0m sai ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc Ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ph\'e1p nh\'e2n kinh t
\u7871\'3f do ng\'fd\'f5i \'f0\'f3 ph\u7909\'3f tr\'e1ch. V\'ed d\u7909\'3f: X\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp A do \'f4ng B l\'e0m Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc c\'f3 n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp C l\'e0 100 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891
\'3fng, nh\'fdng \'f4ng B d\'f9ng ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\'f3 kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fang m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch, d\'f9ng cho c\'e1 nh\'e2n, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp A quy tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\'e1 nh\'e2n cho \'f4ng Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc B y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu Gi
\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f cho ph\'e1p nh\'e2n kinh t\u7871\'3f A, doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp A ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp C
\par Ban thanh to\'e1n n\u7907\'3f c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn tri\u7879\'3fu t\u7853\'3fp nh\u7919\'3fng ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi c\'f3 li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn c\'f4ng n\u7907\'3f tr\u7903\'3f l\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 quan, \'f0\'f5n v
\u7883\'3f c\'f9ng ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi \'f0\'fd\'f5ng nhi\u7879\'3fm \'f0\u7875\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft nh\u7919\'3fng t\u7891\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi do c\'e1 nh\'e2n g\'e2y n\'ean .
