\af39\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  l\'fd \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f, ng\u7915\'3f
ng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu h\u7891\'3fi cho doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp, \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7845\'3fu th\u7847\'3fu t\u7841\'3fo ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn thanh to\'e1n. Gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f b\'e1n l\'e0 gi\'e1 th\u7883\'3f tr
\'fd\u7901\'3fng ( \'f0\u7845\'3fu th\u7847\'3fu ) cao nh\u7845\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tham gia \'f0\u7845\'3fu th\u7847\'3fu. Nh\u7919\'3fng c\'f5 quan, c\'e1 nh\'e2n mua b\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi
\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft. Ti\u7873\'3fn b\'e1n b\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875
\'3f, ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519  l\'fd nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'fd sau:
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft. Gi\'e1 chuy
\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch theo gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, ph\u7847\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch cao h\'f5n gi
\u7919\'3fa gi\'e1 b\'e1n v\'e0 gi\'e1 chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi t\u7841\'3fo ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn thanh to\'e1n.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi mua quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft cho Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc (n\u7871
\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 u c\'f3) th\'ec to\'e0n b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7897\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn b\'e1n b\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7897
\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn (nh\'e0 \'f0\u7845\'3ft) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7893\'3f sung v\'e0o ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn thanh to\'e1n.
\par 6/ C\'e1c Ban thanh to\'e1n n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k\'ea bi\'ean t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa nh\u7919\'3fng con n\u7907\'3f ch\'e2y \u7923\'3f v\u7899\'3fi gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn t\u7915\'3f 200.000 tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean, t
\u7841\'3fm th\u7901\'3fi r\'fat gi\u7845\'3fy ph\'e9p kinh doanh (kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f, t\'fd nh\'e2n) y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'ecnh ch}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7881\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'f0i\u7873\'3fu h\'e0nh \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\u7919\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 ng l\'e3nh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \'f0\u7841\'3fo doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp l\u7849\'3fn tr\'e1nh tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft c
\'f4ng n\u7907\'3f \'f0\u7871\'3fn khi xong. Th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm tra to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f c\'f4ng n\u7907\'3f, \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu Lu\u7853\'3ft ph\'e1 s\u7843\'3fn, n\u7871\'3fu th\u7845\'3fy m\u7845\'3ft kh\u7843\'3f n
\'e3ng thanh to\'e1n theo Lu\u7853\'3ft quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f to\'e0 \'e1n kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng b\u7889\'3f ph\'e1 s\u7843\'3fn doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp, \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft theo Lu\u7853\'3ft ph
\'e1 s\u7843\'3fn (theo ch\u7881\'3f th\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\'e0 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean ng\'e0nh s\u7889\'3f 05 TTLN).
\par 7/ T\u7927\'3f gi\'e1 thanh to\'e1n ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f; c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f v\'e0ng (tr\u7915\'3f R\'fap) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy v\u7873\'3f USD (\'f0\'f4 la M\u7929\'3f) t\u7927\'3f gi\'e1 thanh to\'e1n \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc t\'ednh theo th\u7901\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm k\'ea khai n\u7907\'3f (30/4/91) l\'e0 7900\'f0/ USD.
