\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9331118\charrsid791519 \u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f ta (t\'e0i ch\'ednh) cho b\u7841\'3fn 4.000\'f0/R\'fap.
\par \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd b\'e1n \'f0\u7875\'3f mua l\u7841\'3fi h\'e0ng xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu d\u7921\'3fa theo c\'f4ng th\u7913\'3fc trao \'f0\u7893\'3fi h\'e0ng ho\'e1 \'f0\u7875\'3f t\'ednh gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f thanh to\'e1
n, v\'ed d\u7909\'3f: 1 UR\'ea \'f0\u7893\'3fi l\u7845\'3fy 2 ho\u7863\'3fc 2,5 kg th\'f3c . . . gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f thanh to\'e1n l\'e0 gi\'e1 b\'e1n c\u7911\'3fa 2,    2,5 kg th\'f3c hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi cho 1 kg UR\'ea . . .
\par 8/ Vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e2n t\'edch nguy\'ean nh\'e2n ph\'e1t sinh n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7915\'3f kh\'e2u xu\u7845\'3ft s\u7913\'3f \'f0\u7871\'3fn k\u7871\'3ft th\'fac, \'f0\u7875\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 
